        (4) [practical] reason/logic directs us to carry on for a period [of time] that would
           (in [our] [present] prospect|outlook) be open-ended and likely long

        (5) a safehold highly fit to secure the long-term survival of mind-bearing populations
          extends throughout the cosmos
